17	{"adjudication_status": "decided", "candidate_key": "open-input-degree-equals-vcd", "case": {"g": 6, "n": 6}, "contradicts_claim_ids": [], "created_on": "2026-07-30", "duplicate_of": "FND-0035", "equivalence_group": "open-input-degree-equals-vcd", "evidence_class": "legacy_artifact", "id": "FND-0017", "impacts_approach_ids": ["exact-point-count-or-equivariant-stratification"], "kind": "structural", "reviewer_engines": ["claude"], "scope": {"case": {"g": 6, "n": 6}}, "source_attempt_ids": ["ATT-0011"], "source_review_ids": ["REV-0018"], "statement": "The RED-0001 base-case inequalities coincide with the virtual cohomological dimension boundary for M_{g,n}. For n>=2 the condition k>=2g-2+n is equivalent to 2d-k<=4g-4+n with d=3g-3+n, and for n<=1 the condition k>=2g is equivalent to 2d-k<=4g-6; that is, the ordinary realization degree of every unresolved open input lies at or one below the vcd (for (6,6): degree 26 equals vcd 26; for (6,5): vcd 25). Any forgetful-Leray or stratification route therefore has its higher-degree terms killed for free, and top-degree tools rather than local-system evaluations are the natural attack. Corroboration needed against a primary source for Harer's vcd formula, which is not in the packet corpus.", "status": "retired", "supporting_artifact_hashes": [], "verification_method": "revision-2 adversarial review"}
